      ],
      "text": "Trigger A creature hits the guardian flock with an attack roll\n\n---\nEffect After the attack roll is resolved, the troop pools dimensional magic to rapidly change their position. They cast 4th-rank Translocate, except their range is limited to 40 feet."
    },
    {
